# Line endings for OUR files only (agent, CI, agent docs): LF everywhere,
# overriding core.autocrlf. Target-project files are deliberately left out:
# their committed blobs already contain CRLF, and normalizing them would
# rewrite ~440 target files (ТЗ §4.1.5 — the agent never modifies the target).
# So everything is `-text` (bytes kept exactly as committed, no conversion)
# and only our own paths opt back in to LF normalization below.
* -text
/agent/** text=auto eol=lf
/.github/** text=auto eol=lf
/.claude/** text=auto eol=lf
/.gitattributes text eol=lf
/.gitignore text eol=lf

*.docx binary
*.zip binary
*.pyc binary
